  "generation_prompts": [
    "Create an original sophisticated BACKGROUND ONLY for a 1080x1920 Instagram Story about Nvidia stock-options trading activity. Full bleed 9:16 portrait, no letters, no numbers, no logos, no coins, no portraits, no arrows, no charts or fake tickers. Use a restrained Nvidia-inspired black-and-lime-green color scheme, with charcoal black-glass architecture, faint deep teal reflections and a very subtle plum undertone appropriate to financial options trading. A premium professional trading workstation seen from a slightly low angle occupies only the bottom quarter below y1550: dark monitor backs, beautifully machined desk hardware, subtle green edge lighting, a keyboard and a fine circuit-board motif embedded in the desk. The large central upper area is a clean matte black glass architectural wall, very dark and quiet, suitable for crisp light news text. All eventual authored content fits x104-961 y164-1536 with margins. At upper-right center x865 y265, design an EMPTY front-facing perfectly circular architectural recessed mount with 244px inside diameter, inset into the black wall with an understated bronze metal perimeter and compatible warm contact light. It must be a real physical circular niche, not a floating badge. Do NOT render a coin inside: the user's exact original gold Moneyberg coin will be composited later unchanged. Keep the entire mounting socket in the upper75% and visible. The header later will read MONEYBERG NEWS BRIEF in one compact line, separate OPTIONS INVESTING category, plus official Nvidia logo and large verified trading statistics. These are instructions for reserved space only, render none of the text. Planned authored typography uses actual Lato Black900 for headlines/labels and Georgia400 for source/body; minimum33px all,35body,51headline. Preserve enough dark negative space for a huge 6.43M hero and two large metric panels at y850-1300; reserve y1390-1530 for sources. Make the workstation recognizably about electronic financial markets without screens displaying invented prices or graphs. Elegant cinematic illumination and precise tactile materials, not cyberpunk clutter, not the same semiconductor-package hero as an earnings announcement."
